@startuml
title Activity 18 - Department Next-Month Budget Submission

|Department Executive/Manager|
start
:Open next-month budget page;
:Select target month;
:Review current budget and forecast;
:Enter proposed allocation;
:Add upcoming event assumptions;
|Frontend|
:Validate amount, month and events;
if (Input valid?) then (yes)
  :POST next_month_submission;
  |Backend|
  :Verify authenticated role and own department;
  :Check target month is open;
  if (Submission allowed?) then (yes)
    :Persist budget adjustment request;
    :Set status = PENDING;
    :Notify Finance reviewer;
    :Send submission email;
    |Department Executive/Manager|
    :See pending submission;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Return duplicate or closed-period error;
    |Frontend|
    :Show submission error;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Show input errors;
  stop
endif
@enduml
